{
  "name": "hilbert",
  "namespace": "signal",
  "setup": "x = (1:8)';",
  "expr": "h = hilbert(x); r = real(h); im = imag(h);",
  "iters": 5,
  "tol": 1e-9,
  "fingerprint": [
    "r(1)", "r(2)", "r(8)",
    "im(1)", "im(2)", "im(4)", "im(5)", "im(8)"
  ],
  "comment": "Sig: H = hilbert(X). Analytic signal: real(H)=X, imag(H)=+H{X}. MATLAB R2025b sign convention: positive frequencies multiplied by +i. After fix in toolboxes/signal/src/transforms/hilbert.cpp (added trailing conjugation to compensate for numkit's IFFT-direction FFT primitive).
}
